  "content": "\n\n<h1>Unique Dark Refined</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Unique Dark Refined 在 Modrinth 上\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Unique Dark Refined 在 CurseForge 上\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"AmongstReality 在 Patreon 上的页面\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"AmongstReality 在 Buy Me a Coffee 上的页面\"></a></p>\n<p>Unique Dark Refined 是我另一款资源包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unique Dark</a> 的全面重制版本。</p>\n<p>本资源包为游戏中的每个功能性方块提供了独特的贴图。部分贴图需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 模组才能生效。</p>\n<h2>Unique Dark Refined - Lite 与 Full 版对比</h2>\n<p>Unique Dark Refined - Lite 是该资源包的精简版，可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 上下载。</p>\n<p>Unique Dark Refined - Full 是该资源包的完整版，可在我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 页面上获取。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>警告：</strong>本资源包仅在上述平台提供下载，并在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-dark-refined%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 拥有独立页面。如果您在其他平台上发现它，请<strong>切勿下载</strong>，因为这些都是未经授权的非法分发。这些下载链接可能指向恶意网站，且下载的内容可能包含病毒。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>以下列表展示了 Lite 版和 Full 版分别包含哪些贴图，以及哪些贴图需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能正常工作。未包含在 Lite 版中的贴图也经过重新绘制，以契合本资源包的艺术风格。</p>\n<h3>✅ 包含于 Lite 版：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>熔炉</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>默认潜影盒</li>\n<li>铁砧</li>\n<li>附魔台</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>村民职业变体</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>✅ 包含于 Full 版（除 Lite 版内容外额外包含）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>高炉</li>\n<li>烟熏炉</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>桶</li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>信标</li>\n<li>切石机</li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>制图台</li>\n<li>锻造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>发射器</li>\n<li>投掷器</li>\n<li>合成器</li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚠️ 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>桶</li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>发射器</li>\n<li>投掷器</li>\n<li>村民职业变体</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>在此支持我及我的项目：</h2>\n<p>您可以通过在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 上订阅“Amethyst（紫水晶）”级会员，来访问 Unique Dark Refined 的完整版。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<h2>支持的模组</h2>\n<p>您可以在此处 <a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Refined-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">申请新增模组支持</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Refined-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">反馈现有模组兼容性问题</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Enchanting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-spawners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Spawners</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feasy-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Shulker Boxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Features</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inmis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inmis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flanguage-reload\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shulker Box Tooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftravelersbackpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">yyz's backpack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwoodworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodworks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclayworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clayworks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fboatload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boatload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gallery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenvironmental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>使用条款</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>版权所有 &copy; Unique Dark Refined</p>\n<p>作者：AmongstReality</p>\n<p>作者在各平台的页面链接：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" rel=\"nofollow\">BuyMeACoffee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252famongstreality%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>您可以使用我的素材的情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 Modrinth/CurseForge 上的公开整合包中。</li>\n<li>若您希望为该资源包开发模组支持插件。若进行此类操作，您必须注明清晰的署名，并包含指向原版资源包的链接。</li>\n<li>对原版资源包进行的任何私人修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>您&nbsp;<strong>不可</strong>&nbsp;使用我的素材的情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在基岩版市场（Bedrock Marketplace）上分发。</li>\n<li>设置付费墙（例如 Patreon）。</li>\n<li>在任何平台上分发原始/修改后的素材。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>该资源包在各平台的页面链接：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-refined\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark-refined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
